# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"
msgstr "Configurar o QCSC-Prefect em um cluster Slurm {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide prepares the login node of a Slurm cluster as the workflow host of qcsc-prefect.\n"
"The qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial starts from the result of this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este guia prepara o nó de login de um cluster Slurm como host de fluxo de trabalho do qcsc-prefect.\n"
"O tutorial de SQD do qcsc-prefect parte do resultado deste guia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you complete this guide, you have the following items:\n"
msgstr "Depois de concluir este guia, você terá os seguintes itens:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Where | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, the workflow host | Prefect, the qcsc-prefect packages, and the `qcsc-qrmi` command |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute nodes, inside Slurm jobs | The QRMI worker: QRMI with its `task_runner` command, and `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | The block that names your IBM Quantum&reg; instance and QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node and compute nodes | Your IBM Cloud&reg; API key, instances, and backends for QRMI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Item | Onde | Conteúdo |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Nó de login, o host do fluxo de trabalho | Prefect, os pacotes do qcsc-prefect e o comando `qcsc-qrmi` |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Nós de computação, dentro de jobs do Slurm | O worker do QRMI: o QRMI com seu comando `task_runner` e o `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | O bloco que nomeia sua instância e sua QPU do IBM Quantum&reg; |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Nó de login e nós de computação | Sua chave de API do IBM Cloud&reg;, instâncias e Backends para o QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run each command in a terminal on the login node, unless the step says otherwise.\n"
msgstr "Execute cada comando em um terminal no nó de login, a menos que o passo diga o contrário.\n"

