# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Log in to the login node {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"
msgstr "Passo 1: faça login no nó de login {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install uv {#step-2-install-uv}"
msgstr "Passo 2: instale o uv {#step-2-install-uv}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, and check the installation:\n"
msgstr "Instale o gerenciador de pacotes [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) e verifique a instalação:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Set the paths and create the work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"
msgstr "Passo 3: defina os caminhos e crie o diretório de trabalho {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide and the tutorials use two environment variables:\n"
msgstr "Este guia e os tutoriais usam duas variáveis de ambiente:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Example | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | The qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | The work directory of the solver jobs and the QRMI jobs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Variável | Exemplo | Finalidade |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | O checkout do qcsc-prefect |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | O diretório de trabalho dos jobs do solver e dos jobs do QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both paths must be on storage that the compute nodes see at the same absolute path. If\n"
"your cluster has no `/shared` directory, choose another shared path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Os dois caminhos devem estar em um armazenamento que os nós de computação enxerguem no mesmo caminho absoluto. Se\n"
"seu cluster não tiver um diretório `/shared`, escolha outro caminho compartilhado.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the variables, and create the work directory. Set the variables again in every new\n"
"shell before you follow a tutorial:\n"
msgstr ""
"Defina as variáveis e crie o diretório de trabalho. Defina as variáveis novamente em cada novo\n"
"shell antes de seguir um tutorial:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the variables in every new shell automatically, add them to `~/.bashrc`:\n"
msgstr "Para definir as variáveis automaticamente em cada novo shell, adicione-as ao `~/.bashrc`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"
msgstr "Passo 4: Clone o qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the repository, and check out a release tag, for example `v0.3.1`:\n"
msgstr "Clone o repositório e faça checkout de uma tag de release, por exemplo `v0.3.1`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Create the workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"
msgstr "Passo 5: Crie o ambiente do workflow {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the workflow environment with Python 3.12, and activate it:\n"
msgstr "Crie o ambiente do workflow com Python 3.12 e ative-o:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the qcsc-prefect packages. The `--no-deps` option keeps the exact version pins\n"
"between the packages of the checkout. The tutorial installs the workflow itself:\n"
msgstr ""
"Instale os pacotes do qcsc-prefect. A opção `--no-deps` mantém as versões exatas fixadas\n"
"entre os pacotes do checkout. O tutorial instala o próprio workflow:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the commands are available:\n"
msgstr "Verifique se os comandos estão disponíveis:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate `~/venv/qcsc-host` in every new shell on the login node.\n"
msgstr "Ative `~/venv/qcsc-host` em cada novo shell no nó de login.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Log in to Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"
msgstr "Passo 6: Faça login no Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in to Prefect Cloud. Choose **Paste an API key**, paste a Prefect Cloud API key, and\n"
"choose your workspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Faça login no Prefect Cloud. Escolha **Paste an API key**, cole uma chave de API do Prefect Cloud e\n"
"escolha seu workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the connection. The output shows `PREFECT_API_URL` and your workspace:\n"
msgstr "Verifique a conexão. A saída mostra `PREFECT_API_URL` e seu workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: use your own Prefect server\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Opcional: use seu próprio servidor Prefect\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this note if you use Prefect Cloud. To use your own Prefect server instead of Prefect\n"
"Cloud, follow\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"and set the address of your server in place of `<server-host>`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ignore esta nota se você usa o Prefect Cloud. Para usar seu próprio servidor Prefect em vez do Prefect\n"
"Cloud, siga\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/)\n"
"e defina o endereço do seu servidor no lugar de `<server-host>`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Passo 7: Armazene as credenciais do IBM Quantum {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Execute `qcsc-qrmi login` depois do login no Prefect, porque ele salva o bloco `qrmi-runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Responda às perguntas:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "Cole sua chave de API do IBM Cloud. A chave não é exibida.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Pressione Enter para usar todas as instâncias.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Digite o número da instância padrão, `1` no exemplo a seguir.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Digite o número ou o nome do backend padrão, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) no\n"
"exemplo a seguir.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"O comando também imprime uma nota sobre os nós de computação e linhas `[qrmi]` para\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, que o exemplo omite (`...`). Você não precisa das linhas `[qrmi]`,\n"
"porque o workflow lê a instância e o backend do bloco `qrmi-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "O comando `qcsc-qrmi` tem os seguintes subcomandos:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Comando | Finalidade |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Armazena a chave de API, as instâncias e os backends, e salva o bloco |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Encontra as instâncias e os backends novamente com a chave armazenada |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Imprime as instâncias e os backends, sem a chave |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Verifica se a instância do bloco consegue usar o seu backend |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "Instale o arquivo nos nós de computação {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"O plugin SPANK lê `qrmi_config.json` em cada nó de computação, a partir do caminho em\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, frequentemente `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Peça ao administrador do seu cluster que\n"
"instale seu `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` nesse caminho. Instale-o novamente após cada\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` ou `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mantenha o **Session Mode** do bloco `qrmi-runtime` em `batch`, porque o plugin SPANK\n"
"adquire a QPU em batch mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Passo 8: Crie o ambiente do nó de computação {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"O worker QRMI roda em um nó de computação, em seu próprio ambiente. Crie-o a partir do mesmo\n"
"checkout. A opção `--python` mantém `~/venv/qcsc-host` ativo:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"O pacote `qrmi[ibm]` fornece o comando `task_runner`. O tutorial adiciona o hook de compilação\n"
"SQD a este ambiente e usa `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` como o\n"
"`python_executable` de `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Passo 9: Verifique a configuração {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Verifique se o bloco `qrmi-runtime` existe:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
msgstr "Verifique as instâncias e os backends armazenados. O comando nunca imprime a chave:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the default instance can use the default backend:\n"
msgstr "Verifique se a instância padrão consegue usar o backend padrão:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that Slurm runs a job on both compute nodes, also with PMIx:\n"
msgstr "Verifique se o Slurm executa um job nos dois nós de computação, também com PMIx:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check the compute-node environment and the work directory on a compute node. The first\n"
"command prints nothing when the imports succeed:\n"
msgstr ""
"Verifique o ambiente do nó de computação e o diretório de trabalho em um nó de computação. O primeiro\n"
"comando não imprime nada quando as importações são bem-sucedidas:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos passos {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendações\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Leia [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"para escolher os nós, ranks e threads dos jobs do solver.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"for the configuration file, the solvers, and the run parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Leia o [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"para conhecer o arquivo de configuração, os solvers e os parâmetros de execução.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
